3nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t chi ph\u00ed g\u00ec.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c 03 n\u0103m t\u1ea1i Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Lao \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u1eddi v\u1ee5 01 n\u0103m d\u00e0nh cho N\u1eee c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a trong si\u00eau th\u1ecb v\u1edbi thu nh\u1eadp cao, chi ph\u00ed xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3nh ch\u1ec9 t\u1eeb 55 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-768x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8069\" srcset=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-768x1024.png 768w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-225x300.png 225w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-1152x1536.png 1152w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-1536x2048.png 1536w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-370x493.png 370w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-840x1120.png 840w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/TTS-03-NAM-NHAT-BAN-410x547.png 410w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"724\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/TUYEN-LD-NU-01-NAM-724x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8379\" srcset=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\